meta {
  name: 2f. OpenStack Cluster Create (OpenStack 클러스터 생성)
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/vms
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{$randomUUID}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "vmGroupName": "{{provision_cluster_name}}",
    "provider": "OPENSTACK",
    "description": "OpenStack Nova 기반 Kubernetes 클러스터",
    "environment": "{{provision_environment}}",
    "region": "{{provision_region}}",
    "credentialId": "{{credential_id}}",
    "config": {
      "anycloud-k8s:openstackImageName": "{{openstack_image_name}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:openstackFlavorName": "{{openstack_flavor_name}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:openstackExternalNetworkId": "{{openstack_external_network_id}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:openstackFloatingIpPool": "{{openstack_floating_ip_pool}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:workerCount": "{{worker_count}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:kubernetesVersion": "{{kubernetes_version}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:vpcCidr": "{{vpc_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:podCidr": "{{pod_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:serviceCidr": "{{service_cidr}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:enableIngress": "{{enable_ingress}}",
      "anycloud-k8s:enableGpuOperator": "{{enable_gpu_operator}}"
    }
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.body && res.body.data && res.body.data.id) {
    bru.setEnvVar('last_operation_id', res.body.data.id);
  }
}

tests {
  test("상태 코드 202", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(202);
  });
}

docs {
  ## OpenStack 기반 cluster 생성

  ### Required env vars (local-openstack-provisioning.bru)
  - `provision_provider: OPENSTACK`
  - `provision_region`: OpenStack region (예: `RegionOne`)
  - `credential_id`: OpenStack credential UUID
  - **`openstack_image_name`** (필수): Glance image name (예: `ubuntu-24.04`)
  - **`openstack_flavor_name`** (필수): Nova flavor (예: `m1.large`)
  - **`openstack_external_network_id`** (필수): floating IP 발급될 external network UUID
  - **`openstack_floating_ip_pool`** (필수): floating IP pool name

  ### OpenStack 의 차이점
  - `master_vm_spec` / `worker_vm_spec` 무시 — `openstack_flavor_name` 한 가지 flavor 만 사용
  - region 별 image / flavor 가 다양 — `VM Options` 로 사전 조회 권장:
    ```bash
    bru run "VM Options (VM 옵션)/4. VM Images (OS 이미지 목록).bru" \
        --env local-openstack-provisioning
    ```

  ### 실행
  ```bash
  bru run "VM Cluster (VM 클러스터)/2f. OpenStack Cluster Create (OpenStack 클러스터 생성).bru" \
      --env local-openstack-provisioning
  ```
}
